The total frequency is $80$. Read $Q_1$ at cumulative frequency $20$ and $Q_3$ at cumulative frequency $60$.
On the straight segment from $(10,8)$ to $(20,32)$:
$\begin{aligned}Q_1&=10+\frac{20-8}{32-8}(20-10)\\&=15\text{ cm}\end{aligned}$
On the straight segment from $(30,56)$ to $(40,72)$:
$\begin{aligned}Q_3&=30+\frac{60-56}{72-56}(40-30)\\&=32.5\text{ cm}\end{aligned}$
$\begin{aligned}\text{IQR}&=Q_3-Q_1\\&=32.5-15\\&=17.50\text{ cm}\end{aligned}$
